                                At Professional Development Unit (PDU), we understand that every learner's schedule is different. That's why we offer:
                            </p>
                            <ul class="list-dotted d-flex flex-column gap-8 mb-10">
                                <li>Online <a href="https://pdu-edu.org/4-month-pmp-exam-prep-course-structured-guide-with-pdu" target="_blank">PMP prep courses</a> for flexible learning.</li>
